{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-119909-r4524825","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Nibbles","sourcePageId":119909,"sourceRevision":"4524825","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-18T01:10:52Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Nibbles&oldid=4524825","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:24.376Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Appetizer recipes","Category:Camping recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using bacon","Category:Recipes using cashew","Category:Recipes using cereal","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:United States recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"cc1d45c40517f8659d045caf5b0181e9521af7ada7634146830d8406e73e8685","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Appetizer recipes|servings=20|time=2-2½ hours|difficulty=2}}\n{{nutritionsummary|1/20 of recipe (180 g)|20|823|425|47.2 g|17.8 g|9 mg|1049 mg|78.7 g|7.1 g|5.6 g|20.8 g|12%|5%|16%|61%}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Holiday Recipes|Holiday Recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Snacks|Snacks]]\n\nThis party food, or just anytime snack recipe originated in Rocky Mount, North Carolina.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n===Dry ingredients===\n\n* 2 boxes (16 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]]/1 [[Cookbook:Kilogram|kg]]/2.2 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]]) rice Chex [[Cookbook:Cereal|cereal]]\n* 1 box (8 cups/500 g/1.1 lb) wheat Chex cereal\n* ⅔ box (5 cups/{{convert|320|g|oz|abbr=on|disp=s}}) Cheerios\n* 1 bag (3 cups/{{convert|250|g|oz|abbr=on|disp=s}}) thin pretzels\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (6 cups/450 g) [[Cookbook:Peanut|peanuts]]\n* 1 lb (6 cups/450 g) [[Cookbook:Pecan|pecans]]\n* 1 can (3 cups/{{convert|250|g|oz|abbr=on|disp=s}}) [[Cookbook:Cashew|cashews]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n\n===Sauce===\n\n* 3 sticks ({{convert|375|g|oz|abbr=on|disp=s}}) [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* Heaping ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] ({{convert|150|g|oz|abbr=on|disp=s}}) [[Cookbook:Bacon|bacon grease]]\n* 1¾–2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic salt]]\n* 2 tablespoons plus 1 dash [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* Heaping ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] Accent seasoning ([[Cookbook:MSG|MSG]])\n* 2 heaping tablespoons [[Cookbook:Peanut Butter|peanut butter]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Melt and combine the sauce ingredients.\n# Combine all dry ingredients except salt in a large canning pot.\n# Sprinkle a little of the sauce mixture over dry ingredients, and shake well. Repeat until sauce is gone.\n# Salt the mixture by sprinkling and shaking in the same way.\n# [[Cookbook:Bake|Bake]] 1½–2 hours at 200 °F (95 °C) in covered canning pot.\n# Remove frequently to shake.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* Put the sauce in a canning jar, and punch several holes in the lid. Sprinkle by turning the jar upside down.\n* It took up to seven times of sprinkling and shaking to salt the mixture.\n* It is possible to substitute some vegetable oil for the bacon grease, but the result is less authentic.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Camping recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bacon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cereal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cashew]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Nibbles","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 boxes (16 cups/1 kg/2.2 lb) rice Chex cereal","sourceText":"2 boxes (16 cups/1 kg/2.2 lb) rice Chex cereal","amountText":"2 boxes (16 cups/1 kg/2.2 lb) rice Chex cereal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 box (8 cups/500 g/1.1 lb) wheat Chex cereal","sourceText":"1 box (8 cups/500 g/1.1 lb) wheat Chex cereal","amountText":"1 box (8 cups/500 g/1.1 lb) wheat Chex cereal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"⅔ box (5 cups/) Cheerios","sourceText":"⅔ box (5 cups/) Cheerios","amountText":"⅔ box (5 cups/) Cheerios","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 bag (3 cups/) thin pretzels","sourceText":"1 bag (3 cups/) thin pretzels","amountText":"1 bag (3 cups/) thin pretzels","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 lb (6 cups/450 g) peanuts","sourceText":"1 lb (6 cups/450 g) peanuts","amountText":"1 lb (6 cups/450 g) peanuts","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 lb (6 cups/450 g) pecans","sourceText":"1 lb (6 cups/450 g) pecans","amountText":"1 lb (6 cups/450 g) pecans","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 can (3 cups/) cashews","sourceText":"1 can (3 cups/) cashews","amountText":"1 can (3 cups/) cashews","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"Salt to taste","sourceText":"Salt to taste","amountText":"Salt to taste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"3 sticks () margarine","sourceText":"3 sticks () margarine","amountText":"3 sticks () margarine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-1